{"text":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter","n":"147","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/147"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/147/1","n":"1"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"הַלֲלוּיָהּ כִּי־טוֹב זַמְּרָה אֱלֹהֵינוּ כִּי־נָעִים נָאוָה תְהִלָּה: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/147/2","n":"2"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"בֹּנֵה יְרוּשָׁלַֽ͏ִם "}
{"start":"j:divineName","attrs":{}}
{"text":"יְהֹוָה"}
{"end":"j:divineName"}
{"tail":" נִדְחֵי יִשְׂרָאֵל יְכַנֵּס: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/147/3","n":"3"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"הָרוֹפֵא לִשְׁבוּרֵי לֵב וּמְחַבֵּשׁ לְעַצְּבוֹתָם: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/147/4","n":"4"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"מוֹנֶה מִסְפָּר לַכּוֹכָבִים לְכֻלָּם שֵׁמוֹת יִקְרָא: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/147/5","n":"5"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"גָּדוֹל אֲדוֹנֵינוּ וְרַב־כֹּחַ לִתְבוּנָתוֹ אֵין מִסְפָּר: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/147/6","n":"6"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"מְעוֹדֵד עֲנָוִים "}
{"start":"j:divineName","attrs":{}}
{"text":"יְהֹוָה"}
{"end":"j:divineName"}
{"tail":" מַשְׁפִּיל רְשָׁעִים עֲדֵי־אָֽרֶץ: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/147/7","n":"7"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"עֱנוּ לַ"}
{"start":"j:divineName","attrs":{}}
{"text":"יהֹוָה"}
{"end":"j:divineName"}
{"tail":" בְּתוֹדָה זַמְּרוּ לֵאלֹהֵינוּ בְכִנּוֹר: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/147/8","n":"8"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"הַמְכַסֶּה שָׁמַיִם בְּעָבִים הַמֵּכִין לָאָרֶץ מָטָר הַמַּצְמִיחַ הָרִים חָצִיר: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/147/9","n":"9"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"נוֹתֵן לִבְהֵמָה לַחְמָהּ לִבְנֵי עֹרֵב אֲשֶׁר יִקְרָֽאוּ: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/147/10","n":"10"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"לֹא בִגְבוּרַת הַסּוּס יֶחְפָּץ לֹא־בְשׁוֹקֵי הָאִישׁ יִרְצֶה: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/147/11","n":"11"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"רוֹצֶה "}
{"start":"j:divineName","attrs":{}}
{"text":"יְהֹוָה"}
{"end":"j:divineName"}
{"tail":" אֶת־יְרֵאָיו אֶת־הַמְיַחֲלִים לְחַסְדּוֹ: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/147/12","n":"12"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"שַׁבְּחִי יְרוּשָׁלַֽ͏ִם אֶת־"}
{"start":"j:divineName","attrs":{}}
{"text":"יְהֹוָה"}
{"end":"j:divineName"}
{"tail":" הַלֲלִי אֱלֹהַיִךְ צִיּוֹן: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/147/13","n":"13"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"כִּי־חִזַּק בְּרִיחֵי שְׁעָרָיִךְ בֵּרַךְ בָּנַיִךְ בְּקִרְבֵּךְ: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/147/14","n":"14"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"הַשָּׂם גְּבוּלֵךְ שָׁלוֹם חֵלֶב חִטִּים יַשְׂבִּיעֵךְ: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/147/15","n":"15"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"הַשֹּׁלֵחַ אִמְרָתוֹ אָֽרֶץ עַד־מְהֵרָה יָרוּץ דְּבָרוֹ: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/147/16","n":"16"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"הַנֹּתֵן שֶׁלֶג כַּצָּמֶר כְּפוֹר כָּאֵפֶר יְפַזֵּר: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/147/17","n":"17"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"מַשְׁלִיךְ קַרְחוֹ כְפִתִּים לִפְנֵי קָרָתוֹ מִי יַעֲמֹד: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/147/18","n":"18"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"יִשְׁלַח דְּבָרוֹ וְיַמְסֵם יַשֵּׁב רוּחוֹ יִזְּלוּ־מָיִם: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/147/19","n":"19"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"מַגִּיד דְּבָרָיו לְיַעֲקֹב חֻקָּיו וּמִשְׁפָּטָיו לְיִשְׂרָאֵל: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/147/20","n":"20"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"לֹא עָשָׂה כֵן לְכָל־גּוֹי וּמִשְׁפָּטִים בַּל־יְדָעוּם הַלֲלוּיָהּ: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"end":"t:p"}
